#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:6
msgid "Remote Desktop Enabled"
msgstr "启用远程桌面"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:7
msgid ""
"When disabled, users cannot access the remote desktop page or create new "
"sessions"
msgstr "禁用后，用户无法访问远程桌面页面或创建新会话"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:15
msgid "Require Verified Email"
msgstr "要求邮箱验证"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:16
msgid ""
"Only allow verified users to access remote desktop. Has no effect unless "
"email verification is enabled in CTFd settings."
msgstr "仅允许已验证的用户访问远程桌面。除非在 CTFd 设置中启用了邮箱验证，否则此选项无效。"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:24
msgid "Command Logging"
msgstr "命令日志记录"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:25
msgid ""
"Log shell commands run inside desktop sessions for research analytics. "
"Requires a container image with telemetry hooks installed."
msgstr "记录在桌面会话中运行的 shell 命令，用于研究分析。需要安装了遥测钩子的容器镜像。"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:31
#: src/templates/remote_desktop_dashboard.html:300
msgid "Container"
msgstr "容器"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:33
msgid "Docker Image"
msgstr "Docker 镜像"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:33
msgid ""
"The Docker image used to create each desktop session. Change this if you "
"have a custom image with specific tools or software pre-installed."
msgstr "用于创建每个桌面会话的 Docker 镜像。如果您有预装特定工具或软件的自定义镜像，可在此修改。"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:37
msgid "Memory Limit"
msgstr "内存限制"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:37
msgid ""
"Maximum RAM each desktop can use (e.g. 512m, 1g). Increase if users run "
"memory-heavy applications, decrease to fit more desktops on one server."
msgstr "每个桌面可使用的最大 RAM（如 512m、1g）。如果用户运行内存密集型应用可适当增加，若要让单台服务器承载更多桌面则可减少。"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:41
msgid "SHM Size"
msgstr "SHM 大小"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:41
msgid ""
"Shared memory available to the desktop (e.g. 256m). Browsers and GUI apps"
" use this for rendering. If users see crashes or blank screens, try "
"increasing it."
msgstr "桌面可用的共享内存（如 256m）。浏览器和 GUI 应用使用它进行渲染。如果用户遇到崩溃或空白屏幕，可尝试增加此值。"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:45
msgid "Resolution"
msgstr "分辨率"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:45
msgid ""
"Screen resolution of the remote desktop (e.g. 1280x720). Higher values "
"give more screen space but use more bandwidth and memory."
msgstr "远程桌面的屏幕分辨率（如 1280x720）。更高的值提供更多屏幕空间，但会消耗更多带宽和内存。"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:49
msgid "CPU Limit"
msgstr "CPU 限制"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:49
msgid ""
"Maximum CPU cores each desktop can use (e.g. 1.0 = one core, 0.5 = half a"
" core). Lower values let you run more desktops per server, higher values "
"give users a snappier experience."
msgstr "每个桌面可使用的最大 CPU 核心数（如 1.0 = 一个核心，0.5 = 半个核心）。较低的值可让单台服务器运行更多桌面，较高的值能为用户提供更流畅的体验。"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:53
msgid "Username Source"
msgstr "用户名来源"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:53
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Where to pull the Linux username inside the desktop. Normalized to "
"lowercase letters and numbers, falls back to user{id} if the result is "
"empty."
msgstr "在桌面内提取 Linux 用户名的来源。会被标准化为小写字母和数字，如果结果为空则回退为 user{id}。"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:55
msgid "CTFd Display Name"
msgstr "CTFd 显示名称"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:56
msgid "Email (before @)"
msgstr "邮箱（@ 之前部分）"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:60
msgid "Cap Drop"
msgstr "Cap Drop"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:60
msgid ""
"Linux capabilities to drop from containers, comma-separated. Use ALL to "
"drop everything then selectively add back with Cap Add. Changes only "
"affect new sessions."
msgstr "要从容器中丢弃的 Linux capabilities，以逗号分隔。使用 ALL 可丢弃全部，然后通过 Cap Add 选择性地加回。修改仅影响新会话。"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:64
msgid "Cap Add"
msgstr "Cap Add"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:64
msgid ""
"Linux capabilities to add to containers, comma-separated. These are "
"granted on top of whatever remains after Cap Drop. Must include caps "
"matching any file capabilities on binaries in the image (e.g. nmap needs "
"NET_RAW, NET_ADMIN, NET_BIND_SERVICE) or those binaries won't be "
"executable. Changes only affect new sessions."
msgstr "要添加到容器的 Linux capabilities，以逗号分隔。这些会在 Cap Drop 后保留的 capabilities 基础上授予。必须包含与镜像中二进制文件上的文件 capabilities 匹配的 caps（例如 nmap 需要 NET_RAW、NET_ADMIN、NET_BIND_SERVICE），否则这些二进制文件将无法执行。修改仅影响新会话。"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:69
msgid "Session Timers"
msgstr "会话计时器"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:71
msgid "Initial Duration"
msgstr "初始时长"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:71
msgid ""
"How long a desktop session lasts before it expires. Users will see a "
"countdown timer. Set higher for longer competitions, lower to save server"
" resources."
msgstr "桌面会话在过期前的持续时间。用户将看到倒计时。较长的比赛可设置较高值，较低的值可节省服务器资源。"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:80
msgid "Extension Duration"
msgstr "续期时长"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:80
msgid ""
"How much extra time is added each time a user clicks Extend. Shorter "
"values give users more control over how long they stay, longer values "
"mean fewer clicks."
msgstr "每次用户点击续期时增加的额外时间。较短的值让用户对停留时长有更多控制，较长的值意味着更少的点击次数。"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:89
msgid "Max Extensions"
msgstr "最大续期次数"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:89
msgid ""
"How many times a user can extend their session. Set to 0 for no "
"extensions (hard time limit). Higher values let users keep their desktop "
"alive longer."
msgstr "用户可续期的次数。设为 0 表示不可续期（硬性时间限制）。较高的值允许用户让桌面保持更长时间。"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:94
msgid "Timeouts"
msgstr "超时设置"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:96
msgid "VNC Ready Attempts"
msgstr "VNC 就绪检查次数"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:96
msgid ""
"How many times the server checks if a new desktop is ready before giving "
"up. Increase if desktops fail to start on slower hardware."
msgstr "服务器在放弃前检查新桌面是否就绪的次数。如果在较慢的硬件上桌面启动失败，可增加此值。"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:100
msgid "HTTP Timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "HTTP 超时（秒）"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:100
msgid ""
"How long to wait for a response from Docker when creating or managing "
"desktops. Increase if you see timeout errors on slow networks."
msgstr "在创建或管理桌面时等待 Docker 响应的时间。如果在慢速网络上遇到超时错误，可增加此值。"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:104
msgid "Cleanup Interval (seconds)"
msgstr "清理间隔（秒）"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_config.html:104
msgid ""
"How often the server checks for expired sessions to clean up. Lower "
"values free resources faster, higher values reduce server load."
msgstr "服务器检查过期会话以进行清理的频率。较低的值可更快释放资源，较高的值可减少服务器负载。"

