#: src/templates/remote_desktop_dashboard.html:439
msgid ""
"How long sessions typically last. If most are very short, your timeout "
"may be too aggressive. If most hit the max, users probably need more "
"time."
msgstr "会话通常持续多长时间。如果大多数都很短，可能是超时设置过于激进。如果大多数都达到上限，用户可能需要更多时间。"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_dashboard.html:454
msgid "Session End Reasons"
msgstr "会话结束原因"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_dashboard.html:454
msgid ""
"Why sessions ended: expired, user-closed, or admin-killed. A high expired"
" count means users may need longer timers or more extensions."
msgstr "会话结束的原因：过期、用户主动关闭或管理员终止。较高的过期数意味着用户可能需要更长的计时器或更多续期次数。"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_dashboard.html:472
msgid "Per-Host Breakdown"
msgstr "按主机分布"

#: src/templates/remote_desktop_dashboard.html:472
msgid ""
"Session distribution across Docker hosts. Check if load balancing weights"
" are working or if one host is taking all the traffic."
msgstr "跨 Docker 主机的会话分布。可检查负载均衡权重是否生效，或是否有一台主机承担了所有流量。"

